OL,5,G2305 24 Hours in A&E
OL,6,     FThis episode focuses on families'
OL,7,     Fstrong bonds and the challenge of
OL,8,     Fbreaking bad news. Bill, 92, has a
OL,9,     Fswollen leg and is struggling to
OL,10,     Fbreathe. Andy, 45, has stomach
OL,11,     Fcramps.
OL,12,G0010 Emergency Helicopter Medics
OL,13,     FJohn is trapped in his car after a
OL,14,     Fhead-on collision on the A1, and
OL,15,     Fthe heli-medics fly to one of
OL,16,     FBritain's remotest roads to help
OL,17,     FCaroline, who's come off her
OL,18,     Fmotorbike.
